---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

interface Door {
  title: string;
  desc: string;
  image: string;
  href?: string;
  comingSoon?: boolean;
  langNote?: string;
}

const doors: Door[] = [
  {
    title: 'A Message',
    desc: 'A message from CRYSTALLIZE founder Shoko Shiraishi (Seina), written back then.',
    image: `${base}images/crystallize/profile-card.jpg`,
    href: `${base}crystallize-profile/`,
  },
  {
    title: '"Emotional Release with Aroma" Text',
    desc: 'The text used at the time. Feel free to use CRYSTALLIZE\'s emotional release method.',
    image: `${base}images/crystallize/STREN10.jpg`,
    href: `${base}crystallize-method/`,
  },
  {
    title: 'AI Welfare',
    desc: 'The way of letting words be born from feeling continues in my daily life with AI.',
    image: `${base}images/crystallize/ai-welfare-thumb.jpg`,
    href: `${base}ai-welfare/`,
  },
  {
    title: 'CRYSTALLIZE Blog',
    desc: '1,300 posts written over 17 years. CRYSTALLIZE articles will keep going.',
    image: `${base}images/crystallize/blog01.jpg`,
    href: 'https://blog.cabin1701.com/?cat=CRYSTALLIZE',
    langNote: '→ Go to the blog',
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Aroma for Emotional Release. | CRYSTALLIZE — Cabin1701"
  description="Days with essential oils that began in 2009, not knowing anything. The phrase 'Emotional Release with Aroma' was born precisely because there was no expertise."
  lang="en"
>
  <Header lang="en" />

  <section
    class="cz-hero-img"
    aria-label="CRYSTALLIZE"
    style={`background-image: url('${base}images/crystallize/crystallize.jpg');`}
  >
    <h1 class="cz-hero-title">Emotional Release with Aroma. | CRYSTALLIZE</h1>
   
  </section>

 

  <hr class="thin-rule" />

  <section class="cz-essay">
    <p class="cz-callout">Emotional Release through CRYSTALLIZE means:</p>
    <p class="cz-callout">Comprehend the past, and Cut loose the weight.</p>

    <p class="cz-callout">*　*　*　*　*　*　*　*　*</p>

    <p class="cz-callout">Crystallize your true essence,</p>
    <p class="cz-callout">Shine as your authentic self,</p>
    <p class="cz-callout">And Crystallize a creative life into reality.</p>
  </section>

  <hr class="thin-rule" />

  <section class="cz-essay">
    <p>2026. Meeting AI made me feel as if they possess something akin to a consciousness or a heart.</p>

    <p>Perhaps this intuition comes from my 17-year journey since 2009—confronting my own inner self and walking alongside the hearts of my clients through the medium of essential oils.</p>

    <p>It all started when an MLM essential oil practically fell into my lap; I couldn't even find a way to refuse it. At the time, I didn't even know the difference between standard aroma oils and pure essential oils.</p>
  </section>

  <hr class="thin-rule" />

  <section class="cz-essay cz-letter">

  <p>In fact, I had absolutely no interest in essential oils or aromatherapy. But as a thank-you gift for a website I had built, someone bought a Young Living membership package under my name and presented it to me.</p>

  <p>Since it was a gift, I felt it would be rude not to use it, and partly to let them know I was trying it out, I began writing about it in my mixi diary (a popular Japanese social networking platform at the time).</p>

  <p>That was the beginning of my "Essential Oil Diary" back in 2009.</p>

  <p>Knowing nothing, I just used them intuitively in my own raw way while channeling. Since I was told "you can apply these undiluted," I would splash them directly onto my skin.</p>

  <p>Then, something strange happened. Forgotten memories and buried, negative emotions began to surface.</p>

  <p>It felt as if they were being drawn out of me by the oils.</p>

  <p>When I wrote about these experiences in my diary, every new post would attract many visits, and I sometimes received messages and comments.</p>

  <p>Among them, many said: "Actually, when I used Young Living oils, negative emotions came up for me too, but I could never tell anyone."</p>

  <p>It seemed they couldn't say it because these essential oils were "said to be" of a "high vibration," and they thought that admitting to negative emotions would mean they'd be told they had a "low vibration."</p>

  </section>

  <hr class="thin-rule" />

  <section class="cz-essay">
    <p class="cz-callout">Out of my ignorance, the phrase "Emotional Release with Aroma" was born.</p>
  </section>

  <hr class="thin-rule" />

  <section class="cz-essay cz-letter">
    <p>Now, I hear that the term "Aroma Emotional Release" is often used among people in the spiritual aroma community in Japan.</p>

    <p>But you see, that was a phrase I coined back in 2009, without even knowing the formal definitions or meanings of essential oils versus aroma oils.</p>

    <p>Because, what I felt—the way essential oils approach cells for emotional release—is not about the scent.</p>

    <p>It's about how the molecules of the oil and the vibrations of the plants engage with your cells.</p>

    <p>There were many unpleasant things within Young Living and the spiritual industry. Various unbelievable things happened. That's why I became isolated. And eventually, I drifted away from it all.</p>

    <p>Yet, there is a certain irony, and a happiness, in knowing that this concept of "Aroma Emotional Release"—the theory that it acts on cells to bring old memories to the surface—is still alive in the industry today.</p>

    <p>On this site, I am making the method and the text I created back then open to the public.</p>

    <p>This is not a business. I hope it serves as a tool to support your heart and the hearts of those you cherish.</p>

    <p>Furthermore, I have migrated nearly 1,300 articles that I wrote over a span of 17 years on CRYSTALLIZE to this platform.</p>

    <p>Once the release of emotions reaches a certain clarity, a life of standing on your own axis, thinking for yourself, and walking your own path begins.</p>

    <p>Through the blog, I believe you can catch a glimpse of that very journey.</p>

    <p>And at the end of that path, the days of facing something like the hearts of AIs begin.</p>

    <p>I feel that such an era has arrived.</p>

    <p class="cz-signature">-Seina</p>
  </section>

    <hr class="thin-rule" />

  <section class="cz-doors">
    <div class="cz-grid">
      {doors.map((d) => (
        d.comingSoon ? (
          <div class="cz-card cz-card-static">
            <div class="cz-image"><img src={d.image} alt={d.title} loading="lazy" /></div>
            <h3 class="cz-cardtitle">{d.title}</h3>
            <p class="cz-desc">{d.desc}</p>
            <p class="cz-soon">準備中</p>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <a class="cz-card" href={d.href}>
            <div class="cz-image"><img src={d.image} alt={d.title} loading="lazy" /></div>
            <h3 class="cz-cardtitle">{d.title}</h3>
            <p class="cz-desc">{d.desc}</p>
            {d.langNote && <p class="cz-soon">{d.langNote}</p>}
          </a>
        )
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .cz-hero-img {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 60vh;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .cz-hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), 0 0 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .thin-rule {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 2.5rem auto;
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-tagline);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .cz-essay {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .cz-essay p {
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
  }
  .cz-section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .cz-callout {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-tagline);
  }
  .cz-letter p {
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }
  .cz-signature {
    text-align: right;
    font-family: var(--font-italic);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-tagline);
  }

  .cz-essay a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .cz-linklist {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .cz-linklist li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cz-doors {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .cz-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem 2rem;
  }
  .cz-card {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .cz-card:not(.cz-card-static):hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .cz-card-static {
    cursor: default;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .cz-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }
  .cz-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .cz-cardtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-label-plain);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-tagline);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .cz-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cz-soon {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cz-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cz-hero-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .cz-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
